        "Check if children are involved \u2014 if so, apply WICWA",
        "Contact tribal DV advocate for culturally appropriate services",
        "Coordinate with tribal court if tribal jurisdiction applies"
      ],
      "routing_note": "Some tribes have concurrent jurisdiction. Check if tribal court has issued any existing orders."
